# A Sentry's Peril (sandoria 0) at Aaveleon against The Pickpocket (C#), whose state 2 (available at Step 1, or accepted
# without the Gilt Glasses) answers Aaveleon with the message PICKPOCKET_AAVELEON (Message priority). Available: a trade
# to Aaveleon (no handler: nothing; section 2's 106 would play) and a talk (The Pickpocket's message). Accepted,
# TradedAaveleon 0 (section 2 has no Aaveleon talk): The Pickpocket's message. TradedAaveleon 1 with the case:
# AAVELEON_HEALED (a Message) ties with The Pickpocket's, so the lookup's action cycle plays one then the other; without
# the case 126 (Progress) wins. Completed: AAVELEON_HEALED and The Pickpocket's message tie again.
lists WestRonfaure/Aaveleon/onTrigger WestRonfaure/Aaveleon/onTrade WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/126
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=-431.8,-45.9,342.3 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Sandoria.ThePickpocket accepted
item BoneChip
login
trade Aaveleon BoneChip x1                # A Sentry's Peril available: no handler; nothing
trigger Aaveleon                          # available: The Pickpocket's PICKPOCKET_AAVELEON
quest Sandoria.ASentrysPeril accepted
trigger Aaveleon                          # TradedAaveleon 0: no quest talk; The Pickpocket's message
charvar Quest[0][0]TradedAaveleon 1
trigger Aaveleon                          # no case: 126 (Progress) over the message
finish option=1                           # the Ointment Case
trigger Aaveleon                          # the case: AAVELEON_HEALED and PICKPOCKET_AAVELEON tie: the cycle's first, AAVELEON_HEALED
trigger Aaveleon                          # the cycle's second: PICKPOCKET_AAVELEON
trigger Aaveleon                          # AAVELEON_HEALED again
quest Sandoria.ASentrysPeril completed
trigger Aaveleon                          # completed: the two messages tie: the cycle goes on, PICKPOCKET_AAVELEON
trigger Aaveleon                          # AAVELEON_HEALED
